==English==

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|apple|wine}}. Compare {{noncog|de|Apfelwein}}, {{noncog|nl|appelwijn}}, {{noncog|ang|æppelwīn}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# An [[alcoholic]] [[beverage]] made from apples; [[cider]].

